'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and helmet can be bought from the [[Chemical Agents Premium Warbond|Chemical Agents]] page of the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|250|notext}} and 125 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Advanced Filtration}}

==Trivia==
“Jen Shriver the Science Diver” is likely a play on the title of the {{Tooltip|TV|television}} show ''Bill Nye the Science Guy''.

